# DRUM SING DANCE at Palmwoods

# [![african coop (19)](/media/2013/12/african-coop-19.jpg)](/media/2013/12/african-coop-19.jpg)

Yes, it is that time again!! C'mon kids book your place for the next drum sing dance event in Palmwoods! Join us for Easter FUN! Bring your decorated egg shaker....the wackiest, quirkiest, silliest...WINS A PRIZE!! April 15th 10.30-11.30am Bookings essential. Spaces are limited. Book Now! All ages, family friendly event.
